;; AutoCAD's standard linetypes under their English names, for localized AutoCAD versions whose
;; acad.lin names them in their own language (the Russian one calls CENTER 'osevaya').
;; Loaded by acad_guard/autocad_guarded.py when Linetypes.Load(name, "acad.lin") fails.
